#. The "Composing" section in the settings window
#: Text ID:Composing
msgid "Composing"
msgstr "Kambinavańnie"

#: Text ID:UseXorgRules
msgid "Use sequences from the Xorg project"
msgstr "Vykarystoŭvać pasliadoŭnaści z Xorg"

#: Text ID:UseXorgRulesToolTip
msgid "Use the 3,000 compose sequences from the Xorg project (http://www.x.org/). These are the sequences most commonly found on a standard Linux system."
msgstr "Vykarystoŭvać 3 000 pasliadoŭnaściej z Xorg (http://x.org/). Hetyja kambinacyi čaściej sustrakajucca ŭ Linux-sistemach."

#: Text ID:UseXComposeRules
msgid "Use sequences from the XCompose project"
msgstr "Vykarystoŭvać pasliadoŭnaści z XCompose"

#: Text ID:UseXComposeRulesToolTip
msgid "Use the 1,000 compose sequences from the XCompose opensource project (https://github.com/kragen/xcompose). These sequences may sometimes conflict with the Xorg ones."
msgstr "Vykarystoŭvać 1 000 pasliadoŭnaściej z XCompose (https://github.com/kragen/xcompose). Niekatoryja kambinacyi mohuć kanfliktavać z kambinacyjami Xorg."

#: Text ID:UseEmojiRules
msgid "Use WinCompose emoji sequences"
msgstr "Vykarystoŭvać pasliadoŭnaści WinCompose dlia emodzi"

#: Text ID:UseEmojiRulesToolTip
msgid "Use the compose sequences for Emoji provided by the WinCompose author and contributors."
msgstr "Vykarystoŭvać pasliadoŭnaści dlia emodzi ad aŭtaraŭ WinCompose."

#. A button to visit the donation page (http://wincompose.info/donate/)
#: Text ID:DonationPage
msgid "Donation Page"
msgstr "Achviaravać"

#: Text ID:SwapOnInvalid
msgid "Try to swap the two keys"
msgstr "Sprabavać dzvie klavišy ŭ advarotnym paradku"

#: Text ID:SwapOnInvalidToolTip
msgid "Try to swap the keys of a two-key sequence. For instance, if Compose E A is not a valid sequence, try Compose A E instead."
msgstr "Sprabavać pasliadoŭnaści z dzvuch klaviš u advarotnym paradku. Napryklad, kali pasliadoŭnaści E A nie isnuje, sprabavać pasliadoŭnaść A E."

#. The compose key deactivates itself after a certain configurable delay
#: Text ID:ResetTimeout
msgid "Reset timeout"
msgstr "Čas da admieny ŭvoda pasliadoŭnaści"

#: Text ID:UnicodeInputToolTip
msgid "Enable Unicode input for all characters, even those with no compose sequence defined. For instance, the following sequence will output character U+1A3F: Compose U 1 A 3 F Enter"
msgstr "Uklučyć uvod Junikodu dlia ŭsich simvalaŭ, u tym liku dlia tych, što nie majuć ulasnaj pasliadoŭnaści. Napryklad pasliadoŭnaść Compose U 1 A 3 F Enter uviadzie simval Junikodu U+1A3F"

#. Copy character or symbol to the clipboard
#: Text ID:CopyToClipboard
msgid "Copy to clipboard"
msgstr "Skapijavać u bufier abmienu"

#. Format string to display the current reset delay
#: Text ID:DelaySeconds
msgid "{0} seconds"
msgstr "{0} sekund"

#. The tab item to see all the program authors.
#: Text ID:Authors
msgid "Authors"
msgstr "Aŭtary"

#: Text ID:CheckUpdates
msgid "Automatically check for updates"
msgstr "Praviarać abnaŭlienni aŭtamatyčna"

#: Text ID:CheckUpdatesToolTip
msgid "If enabled, WinCompose will connect to the Internet at regular intervals to check for new versions. Updates are not installed automatically."
msgstr "Kali ŭklučana, WinCompose budzie čas ad času praviarać u internece najaŭnaść novych viersij. Abnaŭlienni nie ŭstaloŭvajucca aŭtamatyčna."

#: Text ID:KeepIconVisible
msgid "Try to keep notification area icon always visible"
msgstr "Pa mahčymaści pakidać bačnym značok u vobłaści paviedamlienniaŭ"

#: Text ID:KeepIconVisibleToolTip
msgid "By default, Windows will remove the icon from the notification area after a short while. This option attempts to keep it always visible."
msgstr "Pa zmaŭčanni, Windows budzie chavać značok z vobłaści paviedamlienniaŭ praz niekatory čas. Hety parametr pasprabuje zrabić značok zaŭsiody bačnym."

#. The user can click on this button to change the current compose key.
#: Text ID:ChangeComposeKey
msgid "Change…"
msgstr "Zmianić…"

#: Text ID:CaptureComposeKey
msgid "Please press a key to use as your compose key."
msgstr "Nacisnicie na klavišu, kab vyznačyć jaje jak klavišu compose."

#. Add sequence to the list of favorites.
#: Text ID:AddToFavorites
msgid "Add to favorites"
msgstr "Dadać u abranaje"

#: Text ID:DisableIcon
msgid "Disable notification area icon"
msgstr "Vyklučyć značok u vobłaści paviedamlienniaŭ"

#: Text ID:DisableIconToolTip
msgid "If enabled, WinCompose will no longer display an icon in the notification area. The only way to open the WinCompose interface will then be through the “WinCompose Settings” and “WinCompose Sequences” entries in the startup menu."
msgstr "Kali ŭklučana, WinCompose bolš nie budzie pakazvać značok u vobłaści paviedamlienniaŭ. Adzinym sposabam adkryć interfejs WinCompose zastaniecca — praz «WinCompose Settings» ci «WinCompose Sequences» u meniu «Pusk»."

#. The name of the “Home” key on the keyboard
#: Text ID:KeyHome
msgid "Home"
msgstr "Home"

#. The name of the “End” key on the keyboard
#: Text ID:KeyEnd
msgid "End"
msgstr "End"

#. The name of the “Tab” key on the keyboard
#: Text ID:KeyTab
msgid "Tab"
msgstr "Tab"

#. Text to show instead of a value in seconds when the reset timeout feature is disabled
#: Text ID:NoTimeout
msgid "No timeout"
msgstr "Biez skidvańnia"

#. The “Advanced” section in the settings.
#: Text ID:Advanced
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Pašyranyja nałady"

#. “regex” is shorthand for “regular expression”.
#: Text ID:IgnoreRegex
msgid "Ignore windows matching this regex:"
msgstr "Ihnaravać vokny, jakija adpaviadajuć rehularnamu vyrazu:"

#: Text ID:IgnoreRegexToolTip
msgid "WinCompose will be completely disabled when the current window class or window name matches this regular expression."
msgstr "WinCompose budzie całkam adklučana, kali klas biahučaha akna budzie adpaviadać rehularnamu vyrazu."

#: Text ID:AlwaysCompose
msgid "Alternate compose key is always Compose"
msgstr "Alternatyŭnyja klavišy compose zaŭsiody imi zastajucca"

#: Text ID:AlwaysComposeToolTip
msgid "If enabled, all compose keys will be treated as Compose in a sequence. By default, only the first pressed key will act as Compose, and alternate compose keys will keep their original role."
msgstr "Kali ŭklučana, usie klavišy compose u pasliadoŭnaści buduć ličycca hetakimi. Pa zmaŭčanni, klavišaj compose ličycca tolki taja, z jakoj pasliadoŭnaść pačałasia, a astatnija vykonvajuć svaju pieršapačatkovuju funkcyju."

#. Remove sequence from the list of favorites.
#: Text ID:RemoveFromFavorites
msgid "Remove from favorites"
msgstr "Vydalić z abranych"

#. Name of the category (Unicode characters, Emoji, User macros, Favorites)
#: Text ID:Favorites
msgid "Favorites"
msgstr "Abranyja"

#: Text ID:TimeoutToolTip
msgid "If set, any compose sequence will be cancelled after a certain delay if no keyboard activity is detected."
msgstr "Kali ŭklučana, liubaja pasliadoŭnaść budzie skinuta pry adsutnaści aktyŭnaści klaviatury ŭ peŭny termin."

#: Text ID:KeyboardLed
msgid "Keyboard LED"
msgstr "Uklučać śviatłodyjod na klaviatury"

#: Text ID:KeyboardLedToolTip
msgid "If set, the corresponding keyboard LED will be lit when a compose sequence is in progress."
msgstr "Kali ŭklučana, na klaviatury budzie zaharacca adpaviedny śviatłodyjod padčas uvodu pasliadoŭnaści."

#. The short name of the compose key
#: Text ID:KeyCompose
msgid "Compose"
msgstr "Compose"

#: Text ID:AutoLaunch
msgid "Launch WinCompose on login"
msgstr "Zapuskać WinCompose pry ŭvachodzie"

#: Text ID:AutoLaunchToolTip
msgid "If set, WinCompose will be started when the user logs in."
msgstr "Kali ŭklučana, WinCompose budzie zapuskacca pry ŭvachodzie ŭ sistemu."

#: Text ID:Accessibility
msgid "Accessibility"
msgstr "Dastupnaść"

#: Text ID:MustHoldCapsLock
msgid "Caps Lock is only active while being held down"
msgstr "«Caps Lock» aktyŭny tolki pry ŭtrymańni"

#: Text ID:MustHoldCapsLockToolTip
msgid "Releasing the Caps Lock key will immediately disable it, instead of the more standard behaviour of having to press it a second time."
msgstr "«Caps Lock» budzie aŭtamatyčna vyklučany pry adpuskańni klavišy, zamiest taho, kab naciskać jaho paŭtorna."

#: Text ID:RunElevated
msgid "Run with elevated privileges (recommended)"
msgstr "Zapuskać z pavyšanymi pravami (rekamiendujecca)"

#: Text ID:RunElevatedToolTip
msgid "Composition will not work in some applications if WinCompose does not run with elevated privileges. This options reduces the chances that this will happen."
msgstr "Kambinavańnie nie budzie pracavać u niekatorych prahramach, kali WinCompose budzie zapuščany biez pavyšanych praŭ. Hety parametr pamianšaje vieragodnaść takich vypadkaŭ."

#. Subtitle on the About tab identifying this build as a fork
#: Text ID:ForkTagline
msgid "PolyKybd fork of WinCompose"
msgstr "Fork PolyKybd prahramy WinCompose"

#. Attribution line on the About tab
#: Text ID:ForkBasedOn
msgid "Based on the original WinCompose by Sam Hocevar and contributors."
msgstr "Zasnavana na aryhinalnym WinCompose ad Sam Hocevar i ŭdzielnikaŭ prajekta."

#. A button to open the original upstream project page
#: Text ID:VisitUpstream
msgid "Visit the original project"
msgstr "Naviedać aryhinalny prajekt"

#. Note under the donation button on the About tab
#: Text ID:DonationNote
msgid "Donations go to Sam Hocevar, the original author."
msgstr "Achviaravańni iduć Sam Hocevar, aŭtaru aryhinała."
